{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026xu3QvlXeLx1786516490.jpg\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">西貢布袋澳有漁排起火，一個男子受輕傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.PTO-1000.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026XmyebqflOP1786510023.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FIRE.PTO-1000.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">火警發生後，多名消防員趕到現場撲救，又出動消防輪向漁排噴灑化學泡沫，一艘舢舨被燒至焦黑。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方早上近8時半接報，布袋澳一號及二號漁排起火，消防出動兩條喉及兩隊煙帽隊，約一小時後火勢受控。一個年約60歲男子手指受傷。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-12T06:40:22.636223+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}